`/lead-reply`, `/unslop-email`, `/inbox-triage`, `/support-loop`, `/founder-voice`, `/social-post`, `/social-reply`, `/changelog-to-post`, `/geo-page`, `/customer-lens`, `/office-hours`, `/ceo-review`, `/retro`, `/browse`, `/teardown`.

